            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuya mchetu ariyekala ndiye nine wa mwana ariye moyo wamuonera mbazi mwanawe, achimuambira mfalume, “Nakuvoya mfalume, msimuolage mwana. Mrichireni iye ahale ye mwana ariye moyo.”",
          "type": "text",
